TIP:  In the intro and instrumental bridge there are two sets double chords.  For the first set aim for a walk up the fingerboard and for the second set it's middle, lower, middle, up.  So for (G) it's 2nd, 3rd, 4th, and 5th strings and then 4th, 3rd, 4th, 5th. 

TIP:  For the transition from (C) to (Cmaj7) just lift off your index finger. 

TIP:  If transposing, play the root chord of the transposed (Gadd) adding the 5th note as necessary.
 
          
